{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38670","headline":"学仙词寄顾云 · 李昭象","name":"学仙词寄顾云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"记得初传九转方，碧云峰下祝虚皇。\n丹砂未熟心徒切，白日难留鬓欲苍。\n无路洞天寻穆满，有时人世美刘郎。\n仙人恩重何由报，焚尽星坛午夜香。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李昭象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38670.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38670","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}